<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cubierta 1996 gross profit down 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cubierta 1996 gross profit down 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's construction group Cubiertas said on Tuesday its pretax 1996 group profit fell by 14 percent to 4.52 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>In a statement, it added that production fell 3.2 percent to 211.2 billion pesetas, due to bad weather conditions in the first quarter of 1996 and to low demand in the industry.</p>
<p>At around 1315, Cubiertas shares were falling 110 pesetas to 13,990.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
